===Etymology===
From {{af|en|Tupper|-ware|id2=substance, kind, or use}}. {{named-after|en|nat=American|occ=businessman|Earl Tupper|wplink==|born=1907|died=1983}}, who invented the product in 1942 and founded the company that produced it. Thus it is a genericised trademark.

